{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stranded on the Moon. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth is calling. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you make the long fall home? </strong><br>Only the top 5% of players can finish the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Long Fall Home</strong>, you\u2019ll leap, boost, and puzzle your way through stunning, low-gravity environments in a gravity-defying platformer like no other. From the desolate silence of the Moon to the orbiting debris fields surrounding Earth, every jump counts in this emotional single-player journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the fun doesn\u2019t stop alone. <br>Gather up to <strong>6 players</strong> online for <strong>chaotic multiplayer races and minigames</strong>!<br>Battle gravity and each other across zany competitive maps where pushing your friends off of platforms is part of the fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Precision Platforming</strong>: Master physics-based movement through challenging space environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Checkpoints: </strong>Don't fall all the way back to the moon when you miss a platform. Instead respawn at your nearest checkpoint, allowing you to push through the storyline easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5<strong>Unlock &quot;Hard Mode&quot; after completing the story on &quot;Easy Mode&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f <strong>Cinematic Story Mode</strong>: A mysterious and emotional solo journey from the Moon back to Earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong>: Race, shove, and sabotage up to 6 players in hilarious online competitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Replayable Maps</strong>: Compete for the fastest time or the funniest fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gamepad Supported</strong>: Designed with tight controls for both keyboard and controller players.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Checkpoint Reached!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574730/28442c3858451e011f432cfbedd09b614fed1116.jpg"},{"name":"First Portal Opened!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574730/b88ffa23d258d0e5f1ce266c81cf1297966c6306.jpg"},{"name":"Arrow Pilot!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574730/d1b3c9c8227b891ac0f2eed9c0d32d10e44da188.jpg"},{"name":"Invisible Path Completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574730/48ea18b7129095ce53f9d8475ca7a02d65bb17fa.jpg"},{"name":"Keyboard Puzzle Completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574730/c19a4f6d84612372cd5317259f702d3f2c33e4ec.jpg"},{"name":"Hedge Maze Completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574730/a43d7a593e856959a752fb618d4eb7f1df88f33f.jpg"},{"name":"All Aboard!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574730/f31251a183c68219228b58e6864ce8bc5ac9a12c.jpg"},{"name":"Colour Puzzle Completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574730/77379eb477b6c6a008e88fb95c44c98e2a03b4e8.jpg"},{"name":"Completed It Mate!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574730/903c49d1706f14ce8b7e067b2e091a91b8239700.jpg"},{"name":"You Saved C.H.A.D!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3574730/50619a133309b49555d3ecb6d339c8dfc0f46f2b.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima